  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IDN; Milj&#xf6; o h&#xe5;llbar utv</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDN; Watershed rehab &amp; en</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att &#xe5;stadkomma en utvecklingsplan f&#xf6;r avrinningsomr&#xe5;det Batanghari Watershed, Jambi - Sumatra. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att  utveckla en planeringsmodell f&#xf6;r milj&#xf6;styrning p&#xe5; kommunal och lokal niv&#xe5; att sedan kunna anv&#xe4;ndas i de andra 39  kritiska avrinningsomr&#xe5;den som identifierats i IDN.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To establish a development plan for Batahangari Watershed in Jambi, Sumatra. This model should be used in future for developmentof the remaining 39 critical watersheds in IDN. This approach will usethe bottom-up approach thus ensuring grassroot/community participationin the entire development process.</narrative>
  </description>
